# shell: tracker
# PVL-051: the scrollbar is a CONTROL.  It was a picture: a pure function
# of the view redrawn every frame, which could be looked at and never used.
wait 6
expect-scroll 0
note a press on the track below the thumb pages the listing down
click 745 400
wait 4
expect-scroll 5
note and a press above it comes back
click 745 105
wait 4
expect-scroll-at-most 1
quit
